mode: "100644"
text: "# The SPARK framework — X growth runs on conversation\n\nX rewards content that **sparks conversation**, not broadcasting. The open-sourced weights are blunt\n(a reply ~27× a like; an author-reply chain ~150×), and the first hour decides out-of-network reach.\nSPARK is the 2026 engine.\n\n## S — Spark conversation\n- Post **native, contestable, reply-worthy** content: a genuine take, a contrarian-but-true claim, a\n  question, a data point people will argue with. Bland broadcasts die.\n- Favor **long-form single posts** and **native video/image** over bare text; **link in the first\n  reply**, never the main post. 1–2 hashtags max.\n\n## P — Premium & profile\n- **Premium is a baseline** for reach in 2026 (significant multiplier; free ≈ near-zero median reach)\n  — but it **amplifies quality, doesn't replace it.** It also unlocks 25k long-form, higher-ranked\n  replies, edit, analytics. Decide it as a **channel-priority** call.\n- Set up the profile to convert reach → follows (clear bio/positioning; ties to `profile-optimization`);\n  build **TweepCred** with a healthy follow ratio and engagement with quality accounts.\n\n## A — Amplify via replies (the afterburner)\n- A standout **reply** on a bigger niche account surfaces in **For You** to people who engaged with it\n  (often 5–20× your baseline). Weight replies to **larger accounts in your niche** (~60/30/10).\n- The algorithm learns who you are by **who you engage with** — reply where your target cluster lives.\n- **Quote-post** with original commentary (never copy-paste — spam filter).\n\n## R — Race the first hour\n- **Engagement velocity in the first 30–60 min** drives out-of-network reach. **Post when your\n  audience is online**; reply to your own early replies immediately to extend the chain.\n- **2–3 quality posts/day**, spaced 30–60 min — quality over volume.\n\n## K — Keep it credible & compounding\n- **Accuracy has distribution consequences** (Community Note penalty) — don't post shaky claims.\n- **No engagement-bait, pods, purchased/coordinated amplification, or copy-paste virality** (detected\n  + penalized). **Bookmarks** = lasting-value signal — make save-worthy posts.\n- Ride **\"expertise moment\"** posts (fast informed take on breaking niche news → follower spikes;\n  ties to `trend-jacking`). Monetization is real but concentrated — earn it as a by-product, don't chase it.\n\n## The X-growth brief a request should fill\n```\nFIT: is X a priority channel for this brand (B2B/tech/finance/real-time)? Premium budgeted?\nPOST: native + contestable; format (long-form / video / image / Article); link in reply\nTIMING: audience-online window; 2–3/day spaced; engage own replies in the first hour\nREPLIES: 60/30/10 into bigger niche accounts; quote with original commentary\nCREDIBLE: verified facts; no bait/pods; bookmark-worthy\n```\n"
